  "name": "steam-trailer",
  "notes": "Trailer 1, draft 7. Calm midday run (two jumps) with the music low; black title cards as in the Mesozoic cut, with a transition sound on each; the drop on the track's own swell: a time-lapse of a full day with shooting stars while the raptor runs an open desert; one storm from first drops to rainbow; the flower stretch, sunset and sunrise in the music's quiet passage; the outfit parade on the second swell (one take, only the outfit changes, no pterodactyls) whose last look runs on into a crash and the game's own game-over screen; the library-hero end card dissolves in over it. Gameplay cuts are matched on the raptor's pose. No rare events: the Steam copy leaves those to be found.",
